-- Quantum UI v4 — 7-tab layout patch (main/world/esp/visuals/character/misc/settings)
-- Creates a secondary structured UI alongside the existing one. Features from
-- the Quantum Native bundle are wired into logical tabs matching the user's
-- reference screenshots.
